WEBVTT

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:06.072
Life was created on this planet...

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:09.803
...and countless species have
appeared and disappeared.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:15.415
Even if human beings
were to become extinct...

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:20.045
...the Earth will continue
to journey across the galaxy.

00:00:21.388 --> 00:00:23.556
Human history, after all...

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:26.226
...is but a mere flicker...

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:29.787
...in the long history of time.

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:32.161
Then, why?

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:34.832
Why are you searching?

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:37.636
For a new era?

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:40.237
Why?

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:47.671
Now, a miracle is about
to be created upon this planet.

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:10.093
Good.

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:12.338
One...

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:17.002
The body effortlessly permeates
through all of the universe.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:24.617
Two...

00:01:24.617 --> 00:01:29.145
Compose oneself,
and exhale onto the earth.

00:01:32.826 --> 00:01:34.157
Juna!

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:36.729
Three...

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:37.497
Three...

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:38.631
Three...

00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:43.864
Look far,
far beyond the limitless.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:53.446
One hot summer day...

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:55.209
...I died.

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:58.281
And then I saw...

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:03.123
This planet...

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:05.421
...as it faced
its death in the future.

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:13.432
Earth Maiden Arjuna

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:19.632
Episode 1: The Drop of Time

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:21.941
Four...

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:24.210
It's not to shoot the target.

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.613
But rather to become one...

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:28.205
...with the target.

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:45.198
Maybe it's just not for me.

00:02:45.198 --> 00:02:47.066
It's not to shoot the target.

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:50.297
But rather to become one
with the target.

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:52.162
Yeah, right...

00:02:52.539 --> 00:02:55.440
I want to become one with you.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:01.181
Don't get so down about this, Juna.

00:03:01.181 --> 00:03:03.979
You still have the fall competition
coming up.

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:10.523
My mom said that...

00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:14.459
...a girl like me should practice the
tea ceremony or flower arrangement.

00:03:14.694 --> 00:03:17.629
That's when I decided
to get into archery.

00:03:18.565 --> 00:03:21.301
But I haven't improved
after all these years.

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:25.135
I always end up getting
emotional and choking.

00:03:30.677 --> 00:03:32.378
Did something happen to you?

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:33.003
Huh?!

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:34.872
Nothing...

00:03:35.114 --> 00:03:37.082
Nothing's happened to me!

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:40.019
Look, if you don't
want to tell me...

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:42.487
...don't feel like you have to,
you know.

00:03:57.737 --> 00:03:58.726
It's coming.

00:04:04.444 --> 00:04:05.502
He got it!

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:08.203
Hey, Tokio...

00:04:09.549 --> 00:04:12.685
Why do birds bother
with catching fish?

00:04:12.685 --> 00:04:13.653
What?

00:04:13.653 --> 00:04:15.450
I mean, birds can fly.

00:04:15.655 --> 00:04:18.825
They have wings and all,
and can fly freely.

00:04:18.825 --> 00:04:22.128
Why would they bother diving
into the water to catch fish?

00:04:22.128 --> 00:04:24.062
Well, that's because...

00:04:24.497 --> 00:04:26.132
That's a weird question.

00:04:26.132 --> 00:04:28.501
I mean, they can fly.

00:04:28.501 --> 00:04:32.460
They can catch other flying creatures
like insects or smaller birds.

00:04:32.639 --> 00:04:35.403
Well, when you put it that way...

00:04:36.709 --> 00:04:38.544
I know. They like it!

00:04:38.544 --> 00:04:39.374
Like it?

00:04:39.646 --> 00:04:40.613
That's right.

00:04:40.613 --> 00:04:44.049
Those birds probably like
the taste of fish.

00:04:45.518 --> 00:04:47.349
They like it, huh?

00:05:03.736 --> 00:05:05.294
Yeah!

00:05:07.273 --> 00:05:09.776
I wonder how far you can see...

00:05:09.776 --> 00:05:11.744
...if you can fly so high.

00:05:12.145 --> 00:05:16.015
You might be able to see
to the ends of the earth.

00:05:16.015 --> 00:05:18.449
Ends of the earth, huh?

00:05:22.221 --> 00:05:23.620
Hey, Tokio.

00:05:24.257 --> 00:05:27.126
The sea. Let's go to the sea.

00:05:27.126 --> 00:05:27.827
Huh?

00:05:27.827 --> 00:05:29.886
Come on. Let's go. The sea!

00:05:29.996 --> 00:05:32.021
You have a fever or something?

00:05:33.733 --> 00:05:35.030
I guess not.

00:05:35.201 --> 00:05:37.226
Do you know where you are?

00:05:38.571 --> 00:05:40.095
The sea is right there!

00:05:43.676 --> 00:05:45.244
This isn't the sea.

00:05:45.244 --> 00:05:46.040
What?

00:05:46.446 --> 00:05:50.616
It just seems so bound up
and constricting.

00:05:50.616 --> 00:05:52.049
I feel suffocated.

00:05:52.752 --> 00:05:55.482
You sure are demanding.

00:05:55.822 --> 00:05:59.690
It's still a lot better than
the sea in Tokyo, you know.

00:06:01.928 --> 00:06:03.122
All right!

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.603
How about we head up north?

00:06:10.603 --> 00:06:11.571
Up north?

00:06:11.571 --> 00:06:13.172
If we take off now...

00:06:13.172 --> 00:06:17.609
...we can catch the sun dip into the
wild waters of the Sea of Japan.

00:06:18.444 --> 00:06:19.274
Tokio!

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:01.709
All right!

00:07:12.265 --> 00:07:15.200
Look, the birds...

00:07:49.202 --> 00:07:51.704
Huh? That's me down there.

00:07:51.704 --> 00:07:54.332
Don't die, Juna!

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.238
Tokio?

00:07:59.712 --> 00:08:00.940
Is that Tokio?

00:08:13.059 --> 00:08:13.693
Juna...

00:08:13.693 --> 00:08:15.194
Tokio?

00:08:15.194 --> 00:08:16.559
Hey, Tokio.

00:08:19.599 --> 00:08:22.864
I'm here! I'm right here!

00:08:35.381 --> 00:08:38.009
Don't tell me I...

00:08:39.852 --> 00:08:41.547
...died?

00:08:44.323 --> 00:08:45.551
Wh-What is this...?!

00:09:08.147 --> 00:09:10.081
So beautiful...!

00:09:17.557 --> 00:09:18.489
What...?!

00:09:27.633 --> 00:09:29.328
N-No...!

00:09:32.672 --> 00:09:34.970
I've found you. I've found you...

00:09:35.141 --> 00:09:37.473
I've found you. I've found you...

00:09:42.882 --> 00:09:43.871
I've found you...

00:10:15.348 --> 00:10:17.783
I've finally found you.

00:10:17.783 --> 00:10:22.379
The one who will save all life
on this planet.

00:10:27.526 --> 00:10:29.829
I've found you...

00:10:29.829 --> 00:10:30.955
...Juna.

00:10:31.964 --> 00:10:32.798
What?!

00:10:32.798 --> 00:10:36.268
You will purify the demons
that bring on the end.

00:10:36.268 --> 00:10:40.039
Juna, the Avatar of Time who
will lead the way to the future.

00:10:40.039 --> 00:10:42.633
Who are you?
Who are you, anyway?

00:10:42.775 --> 00:10:44.510
I am Chris.

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:49.115
I will protect you and
give you guidance.

00:10:49.115 --> 00:10:50.582
Chris?

00:10:59.225 --> 00:11:02.285
What... What is that?

00:11:02.495 --> 00:11:05.765
They will bring about
the end of this planet.

00:11:05.765 --> 00:11:06.899
The Raaja.

00:11:06.899 --> 00:11:07.957
Raaja?

00:11:08.467 --> 00:11:09.735
You will fight them.

00:11:09.735 --> 00:11:11.437
Demons that must be purged.

00:11:11.437 --> 00:11:12.438
Demons?

00:11:12.438 --> 00:11:13.906
Fight them?

00:11:13.906 --> 00:11:14.974
But, why...?

00:11:14.974 --> 00:11:17.176
Why do I have to fight
those monsters?

00:11:17.176 --> 00:11:19.940
Juna, Avatar of Time.

00:11:23.282 --> 00:11:25.584
Life on this planet...

00:11:25.584 --> 00:11:28.576
...is about to face extinction.

00:11:30.056 --> 00:11:33.559
If you are able to fight the Raaja...

00:11:33.559 --> 00:11:37.222
...purge this planet of them,
and lead the way to the future...

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:41.261
...I will save your life
this one time.

00:11:41.667 --> 00:11:42.998
My life?

00:11:43.502 --> 00:11:45.129
You really can do that?

00:11:46.338 --> 00:11:47.805
I'm sorry.

00:11:48.207 --> 00:11:50.743
I did the best I could, but...

00:11:50.743 --> 00:11:52.411
No...

00:11:52.411 --> 00:11:54.213
How could this be...?

00:11:54.213 --> 00:11:56.704
Juna! Where's Juna?!

00:11:59.151 --> 00:12:01.984
Juna! Juna!

00:12:03.689 --> 00:12:06.058
Huh? Could that be...?

00:12:06.058 --> 00:12:07.927
Tokio...! Mom...!

00:12:07.927 --> 00:12:09.361
Juna...!

00:12:09.361 --> 00:12:12.298
Tokio! Mom!

00:12:12.298 --> 00:12:14.459
- I'll ask you again.
- Huh?

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:16.535
If you will take our place...

00:12:16.535 --> 00:12:18.304
...and fight the Raaja...

00:12:18.304 --> 00:12:20.906
...and purge this world of them...

00:12:20.906 --> 00:12:22.374
...I will...

00:12:22.374 --> 00:12:24.777
...I will save your life.

00:12:24.777 --> 00:12:28.213
But, that's impossible.

00:12:28.414 --> 00:12:30.616
There's no way I can fight it.

00:12:30.616 --> 00:12:32.140
How do you know that?

00:12:32.685 --> 00:12:35.855
How would you know
without even trying?

00:12:35.855 --> 00:12:37.152
Well I...

00:12:37.623 --> 00:12:40.493
Juna! Come on, open your eyes!

00:12:40.493 --> 00:12:41.927
Tokio...

00:12:41.927 --> 00:12:43.292
Tokio!

00:12:51.303 --> 00:12:55.399
Earth Maiden Arjuna

00:13:00.379 --> 00:13:01.812
Juna...

00:13:06.452 --> 00:13:08.682
- Doctor! There's a pulse!
- What?

00:13:13.959 --> 00:13:16.128
- I have to go.
- Huh?

00:13:16.128 --> 00:13:17.254
I have to go.

00:13:21.734 --> 00:13:23.133
Juna...

00:13:24.069 --> 00:13:25.471
Are you all right?

00:13:25.471 --> 00:13:27.029
- Juna!
- Nurse Okada, find that patient!

00:13:38.384 --> 00:13:39.442
Get on.

00:13:40.953 --> 00:13:43.285
Come on! Take it easy!

00:13:44.957 --> 00:13:45.946
Juna!

00:13:49.361 --> 00:13:50.385
Juna!

00:13:51.897 --> 00:13:52.693
Tokio?

00:13:53.165 --> 00:13:54.189
What is this?!

00:13:55.801 --> 00:13:57.063
What's going on?!

00:13:59.705 --> 00:14:01.574
Sorry, I...

00:14:01.574 --> 00:14:02.598
I have to go.

00:14:05.678 --> 00:14:06.770
W-Wait!

00:14:08.781 --> 00:14:11.409
Tokio... Mom...

00:14:14.753 --> 00:14:16.721
What's going on...?

00:14:26.966 --> 00:14:29.457
Th-Thank you very much.

00:14:32.304 --> 00:14:33.293
Uh, um...

00:14:46.886 --> 00:14:48.012
Who are you?!

00:14:58.964 --> 00:15:00.299
Don't tell me...

00:15:00.299 --> 00:15:01.891
Don't tell me this child...

00:15:02.334 --> 00:15:04.165
It's your fault.

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:06.305
Because of you, Chris was...

00:15:06.305 --> 00:15:08.535
Wh-Where are you?

00:15:08.774 --> 00:15:11.072
You're awfully slow, you dimwit.

00:15:11.644 --> 00:15:13.669
Huh? Was that you?

00:15:13.946 --> 00:15:16.582
In order to save you...

00:15:16.582 --> 00:15:18.884
...Chris sacrificed himself.

00:15:18.884 --> 00:15:20.319
Wh-Why, you little...

00:15:20.319 --> 00:15:23.584
You little brat! Don't accuse me!

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:25.824
Is this some kind of joke?

00:15:25.824 --> 00:15:28.961
He's the one who said
he would save me!

00:15:28.961 --> 00:15:29.929
N-No way...

00:15:29.929 --> 00:15:32.998
Th-This girl's reading my mind...

00:15:32.998 --> 00:15:35.434
You just realized that, you dimwit?

00:15:35.434 --> 00:15:37.736
Don't be so shocked
by a little telepathy.

00:15:37.736 --> 00:15:40.034
It's okay, Cindy.

00:15:40.139 --> 00:15:42.608
Chris, don't force yourself.

00:15:42.608 --> 00:15:44.838
Juna, Avatar of Time.

00:15:45.044 --> 00:15:49.743
You will now be working with us
as a member of S. E. E. D.

00:15:50.516 --> 00:15:51.983
S. E. E. D?

00:15:52.918 --> 00:15:56.081
I give you the Drop of Time.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.558
Huh? A power stone?

00:15:59.558 --> 00:16:01.460
The Drop of Time...

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:04.897
...was created by people
who lived in ancient times.

00:16:04.897 --> 00:16:06.665
The Drop of Time?

00:16:06.665 --> 00:16:08.000
It is a holy stone...

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:10.269
...that can gain the power
of the Earth...

00:16:10.269 --> 00:16:13.363
...by sympathizing with the planet.

00:16:14.139 --> 00:16:16.937
Sympathizing with the planet?

00:16:47.172 --> 00:16:49.367
Wh-What is this?

00:17:05.624 --> 00:17:08.360
Malfunction in the primary
cooling system.

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:11.730
Voltage dropping in
circuits A-7 and B-5.

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:15.034
There's a disturbance
in Reactor 4.

00:17:15.034 --> 00:17:16.228
What's the cause?

00:17:16.368 --> 00:17:17.836
We're still investigating...

00:17:17.836 --> 00:17:20.005
...but I don't see any abnormalities
in the control circuits.

00:17:20.005 --> 00:17:21.097
I see.

00:17:22.908 --> 00:17:26.105
I'm Teresa Wong of the
S. E. E. D. Investigation Bureau.

00:17:26.612 --> 00:17:29.513
We're here to investigate magnetic
anomalies detected in the area.

00:17:30.149 --> 00:17:33.485
I'm Dojima, I'm in charge
of the reactor.

00:17:33.485 --> 00:17:36.121
What the hell is all that crap?!

00:17:36.121 --> 00:17:40.025
I don't know what strings you
pulled over our chairman...

00:17:40.025 --> 00:17:41.960
...but our facilities are perfect.

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:44.963
I don't appreciate outsiders coming
in and having their way with things.

00:17:44.963 --> 00:17:48.033
Of course,
we don't intend to interfere.

00:17:48.033 --> 00:17:51.937
However, I can't imagine that
any technology can be perfect.

00:17:51.937 --> 00:17:53.072
Look...

00:17:53.072 --> 00:17:55.941
...our reactors have three
back-up safety systems...

00:17:55.941 --> 00:17:57.772
...which are able to
handle any situation.

00:17:59.344 --> 00:18:01.369
Would you wager on that?

00:18:03.982 --> 00:18:05.350
No way!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:07.753
How can I protect
a nuclear reactor...

00:18:07.753 --> 00:18:09.121
...on my own!

00:18:09.121 --> 00:18:10.315
Don't be afraid.

00:18:11.757 --> 00:18:13.158
Abandon your fears...

00:18:13.158 --> 00:18:16.662
...and awaken the power of
the planet that lies within you.

00:18:16.662 --> 00:18:17.959
Power of the planet?

00:18:18.831 --> 00:18:20.466
Don't be afraid.

00:18:20.466 --> 00:18:22.935
No matter what may happen...

00:18:22.935 --> 00:18:25.904
...you must restrain
your fears and doubts...

00:18:25.904 --> 00:18:28.774
...as once you become
one with the planet...

00:18:28.774 --> 00:18:30.901
...a path shall open up before you.

00:18:32.511 --> 00:18:35.480
Come on!
Don't I have any say in this?!

00:18:38.984 --> 00:18:39.643
What?!

00:18:41.753 --> 00:18:43.455
Abnormal traces approaching.

00:18:43.455 --> 00:18:44.353
- It's coming.
- What?!

00:18:53.031 --> 00:18:55.300
Stay calm.
Start the emergency generators.

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:57.402
All sections, check safety systems.

00:18:57.402 --> 00:18:58.562
Yes, sir.

00:19:00.539 --> 00:19:01.840
Reactors 2 and 3...

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:04.009
...automatic shut down system
commencing.

00:19:04.009 --> 00:19:05.744
What about Reactors 1 and 4?

00:19:05.744 --> 00:19:06.645
Not working.

00:19:06.645 --> 00:19:09.615
Perhaps a malfunction from
the voltage mishap from earlier.

00:19:09.615 --> 00:19:12.017
Remove the reactor rods
immediately.

00:19:12.017 --> 00:19:12.711
Yes, sir!

00:19:18.957 --> 00:19:20.726
Is it fear?

00:19:20.726 --> 00:19:22.427
I think you made a mistake.

00:19:22.427 --> 00:19:26.193
How can an ugly girl like her take
your place as the Avatar of Time?

00:19:31.637 --> 00:19:33.070
A fire?!

00:19:40.078 --> 00:19:42.876
Chris, when will
the Avatar of Time awaken?

00:19:51.857 --> 00:19:54.155
I suppose there's no avoiding it.

00:19:56.695 --> 00:19:58.629
Chris, are you all right?!

00:19:59.298 --> 00:20:00.458
Where to? Where?

00:20:09.341 --> 00:20:10.808
Wh-What is this bird?!

00:20:12.477 --> 00:20:13.879
Bird?

00:20:13.879 --> 00:20:15.039
That couldn't be...?!

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:16.005
Juna?!

00:20:22.554 --> 00:20:23.714
What the...?!

00:20:37.202 --> 00:20:39.602
Juna! Are you there?!

00:20:40.305 --> 00:20:41.907
No... Tokio...?

00:20:41.907 --> 00:20:43.175
Juna!

00:20:43.175 --> 00:20:44.335
Tokio!

00:20:44.443 --> 00:20:46.502
- Tokio!
- Juna!

00:21:06.565 --> 00:21:08.192
Tokio!

00:22:07.993 --> 00:22:10.028
Confirming Earth Sympathy Reaction!

00:22:10.028 --> 00:22:12.497
That girl couldn't be...

00:22:12.497 --> 00:22:13.828
...the Avatar of Time.

00:22:20.172 --> 00:22:21.434
Juna...

00:22:24.376 --> 00:22:25.934
It's started to move.

00:22:26.778 --> 00:22:28.746
For me and the earth.

00:22:29.247 --> 00:22:32.351
And also, for him.

00:22:32.351 --> 00:22:34.478
A new era has begun.

00:22:39.057 --> 00:22:44.120
Arjuna

00:22:54.139 --> 00:23:00.946
Yesterday's rains

00:23:00.946 --> 00:23:05.883
Brought cold stars to the eastern city

00:23:06.585 --> 00:23:13.158
Quietly and sadly

00:23:13.158 --> 00:23:20.121
You hum my favorite song

00:23:21.066 --> 00:23:25.637
I have to go, or no one will save

00:23:25.637 --> 00:23:29.141
The boy who wandered

00:23:29.141 --> 00:23:33.345
Into the deep darkness

00:23:33.345 --> 00:23:38.016
With love alone, I will go

00:23:38.016 --> 00:23:41.353
No matter where you are

00:23:41.353 --> 00:23:45.724
I will go running straight to you

00:23:45.724 --> 00:23:50.662
So, in a loud voice

00:23:50.662 --> 00:23:59.331
Call out my name again and again
